            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Sarah E. Harrington, kansas (the petitioner) contends that it is always reasonable to presume that a car is being driven by its unlicensed owner."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Sarah E. Harrington",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "efd3f60c6f52c0fd19b23e82a96d4b1c84d12dcbf04e379693f0f9a5f4bf0088",
